        {"zh": "静静地等猎物。", "en": "Wait quietly for prey."},
        {"zh": "食物的味道不错。", "en": "The food tastes good."},
        {"zh": "我在这里等待。", "en": "I wait here."},
        {"zh": "我需要保持安静。", "en": "I need to stay quiet."},
